scope:
A repeat holistic Gate G architectural-clay review of the exact GLB: sha256 verified, 4,702,036 bytes, no images or textures, 31 meshes, 66,915 triangles. It was checked against the locked oblique (variant_0_angle_60.jpg) and roof view (variant_0_angle_90.jpg); variant_0.png was excluded as instructed. Every v007 and v009 finding was re-tested, and the full regression was re-run:
- the builder's 18 renders and 4 phone boards;
- 66 reviewer renders of the exact GLB: the complete v009 camera roster, plus festoon, stack-collar, summit-slot, plant/pavilion-junction and overhead orthographic summit and stack views; one derived crop; and seven see-through tests against a magenta background;
- Python geometry checks: component inventory; the slot-window ray test re-run after the slot-limit change; the overhead exposure test of every reveal; the inner-parapet continuity probe; a coplanar-overlap search; winding against stored normals; stack section, taper and collar-seat sweeps; pier closure rays; support contact; and window-head gaps compared with v009.
This review grants no keeper, runtime or publication approval.
